/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Term\040structure\040extrapolation\040and\040asymptotic\040forward\040rates)
/Author (J\056B\056J\056M\056\040De\040Kort\054\040Michel\040Vellekoop)
/Subject (We\040investigate\040different\040inter\055\040and\040extrapolation\040methods\040for\040term\040structures\040under\040different\040constraints\040in\040order\040to\040generate\040market\055consistent\040estimates\040which\040describe\040the\040asymptotic\040behavior\040of\040forward\040rates\056\040Our\040starting\040point\040is\040the\040method\040proposed\040by\040Smith\040and\040Wilson\054\040which\040is\040used\040by\040the\040European\040insurance\040supervisor\040EIOPA\056\040We\040use\040the\040characterization\040of\040the\040Smith\205Wilson\040class\040of\040interpolating\040functions\040as\040the\040solution\040to\040a\040functional\040optimization\040problem\040to\040extend\040their\040approach\040in\040such\040a\040way\040that\040forward\040rates\040will\040converge\040to\040a\040value\040which\040is\040an\040outcome\040of\040the\040optimization\040process\056\040Precise\040conditions\040are\040stated\040which\040guarantee\040that\040the\040optimization\040problems\040involved\040are\040well\055posed\040on\040appropriately\040chosen\040function\040spaces\056\040As\040a\040result\054\040a\040well\055defined\040optimal\040asymptotic\040forward\040rate\040can\040be\040derived\040directly\040from\040prices\040and\040cashflows\040of\040traded\040instruments\056\040This\040allows\040practitioners\040to\040use\040raw\040market\040data\040to\040extract\040information\040about\040long\040term\040forward\040rates\054\040as\040we\040will\040show\040in\040a\040study\040which\040analyzes\040historical\040EURIBOR\040swap\040data\056)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402016\054\040Insurance\040Mathematics\040\046\040Economics\054\040LIBOR\040market\040model\054\040Forward\040rate\054\040Optimization\040problem\054\040Term\040\050time\051\054\040Extrapolation\054\040University\040of\040Amsterdam)
>>
